==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Spacefish Jones]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Once you get your COTC1 Crystals, this is just you trying to chip down Spacefish Jones and Le'Solar inbetween GreGory waves. This is easily down with Area Attackers like [[Seafarer Cat]] and [[Drama Cats]].

